#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:394
msgid ""
"Customers pay to the bank accounts of the Direct bank transfer payment "
"method; with more than one account they choose at checkout. This IBAN is "
"used only if Direct bank transfer has no valid account, and for orders "
"placed before the customer could choose."
msgstr ""
"Kupci plaćaju na bankovne račune načina plaćanja izravni bankovni prijenos; "
"ako ih je više, biraju račun na blagajni. Ovaj IBAN koristi se samo ako "
"izravni bankovni prijenos nema ispravan račun te za narudžbe zaprimljene "
"prije nego što je kupac mogao birati."

