"Trebate lokalno generiranje kodova, SEPA QR kodove ili podsjetnike za "
"plaćanje?"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:534
#: includes/class-wsb-hub3-paybycode-notice.php:91
msgid "Explore WSB PayByCode"
msgstr "Upoznajte WSB PayByCode"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:544
msgid "WSB PayByCode for WooCommerce"
msgstr "WSB PayByCode for WooCommerce"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:546
msgid ""
"WSB PayByCode is active and replaces WSB HUB3. Deactivate WSB HUB3 to avoid "
"showing duplicate payment details and codes."
msgstr ""
"WSB PayByCode je aktivan i zamjenjuje WSB HUB3. Deaktivirajte WSB HUB3 kako "
"biste izbjegli dvostruki prikaz podataka za plaćanje i kodova."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:548
msgid ""
"WSB HUB3 is the free plugin for Croatian HUB-3 bank transfer payments. WSB "
"PayByCode for WooCommerce is a separate paid plugin for SEPA bank transfers, "
"including Croatian payments. It replaces WSB HUB3; it is not an add-on and "
"the two plugins are not intended to run together."
msgstr ""
"WSB HUB3 je besplatan plugin za hrvatske HUB-3 bankovne uplate. WSB "
"PayByCode for WooCommerce zaseban je komercijalni plugin za SEPA bankovne "
"uplate, uključujući hrvatske uplate. Zamjenjuje WSB HUB3; nije njegov "
"dodatak i ta dva plugina nisu predviđena za istodobni rad."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:549
msgid "What WSB PayByCode offers"
msgstr "Što nudi WSB PayByCode"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:551
msgid "Local generation, privacy and GDPR"
msgstr "Lokalno generiranje, privatnost i GDPR"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:551
msgid ""
"Payment codes are generated on your server. The customer and payment details "
"needed to create them are not sent to an external barcode service, reducing "
"third-party processing and giving you more control over personal data in the "
"context of GDPR."
msgstr ""
"Kodovi za plaćanje generiraju se na vašem poslužitelju. Podaci kupaca i "
"plaćanja potrebni za njihovu izradu ne šalju se vanjskom barcode servisu. "
"Time se smanjuje obrada kod trećih strana i dobivate veću kontrolu nad "
"osobnim podacima u kontekstu GDPR-a."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:552
msgid "No network wait for code generation"
msgstr "Generiranje kodova bez mrežnog čekanja"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:552
msgid ""
"Code generation avoids sending data over the network and waiting for a "
"barcode API response. Actual generation time still depends on your server."
msgstr ""
"Generiranje kodova ne zahtijeva slanje podataka mrežom ni čekanje odgovora "
"vanjskog barcode API-ja. Stvarno vrijeme generiranja i dalje ovisi o vašem "
"poslužitelju."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:553
msgid "Independence from an external barcode service"
msgstr "Neovisnost o vanjskom barcode servisu"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:553
msgid ""
"Generating payment codes does not depend on the availability, rate limits or "
"response times of a third-party barcode service."
msgstr ""
"Generiranje kodova za plaćanje ne ovisi o dostupnosti, ograničenjima broja "
"zahtjeva ni odzivu vanjskog barcode servisa."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:554
msgid "HUB-3 and SEPA payments"
msgstr "HUB-3 i SEPA plaćanja"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:554
msgid ""
"Use HUB-3 for Croatian payments and EPC QR codes for supported SEPA "
"payments. Scanning EPC QR codes requires a banking app that supports the "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Koristite HUB-3 za hrvatske uplate i EPC QR kodove za podržana SEPA "
"plaćanja. Za skeniranje EPC QR kodova potrebna je bankovna aplikacija koja "
"podržava taj format."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:555
msgid "Bank accounts by country and currency"
msgstr "Bankovni računi prema zemlji i valuti"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:555
msgid ""
"Manage bank accounts with rules by country and currency, with an optional "
"account choice at checkout."
msgstr ""
"Upravljajte bankovnim računima uz pravila prema zemlji i valuti te mogućnost "
"izbora računa na blagajni."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:556
msgid "Payment follow-up and practical tools"
msgstr "Praćenje plaćanja i praktični alati"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:556
msgid ""
"Set up payment reminders and automatic cancellation of unpaid orders, offer "
"copy buttons for payment details, include codes in WP Overnight PDF "
"invoices, and translate custom text with Polylang or WPML."
msgstr ""
"Postavite podsjetnike za plaćanje i automatsko otkazivanje neplaćenih "
"narudžbi, ponudite gumbe za kopiranje podataka za plaćanje, uključite kodove "
"u WP Overnight PDF račune i prevedite prilagođene tekstove uz Polylang ili "
"WPML."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:558
msgid ""
"The privacy benefit applies to payment code generation. License activation "
"and update checks communicate separately with the licensing and update "
"service. Local generation alone does not guarantee GDPR compliance."
msgstr ""
"Prednost u pogledu privatnosti odnosi se na generiranje kodova za plaćanje. "
"Aktivacija licence i provjere nadogradnji zasebno komuniciraju sa servisom "
"za licenciranje i nadogradnje. Samo lokalno generiranje ne jamči usklađenost "
"s GDPR-om."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:559
msgid "Requirements and license"
msgstr "Zahtjevi i licenca"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:560
msgid "Requires PHP 8.2+, WordPress 6.5+ and WooCommerce 9.0+."
msgstr "Zahtijeva PHP 8.2+, WordPress 6.5+ i WooCommerce 9.0+."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:561
msgid ""
"The paid license includes one year of updates and email support. The "
"installed plugin's features continue to work after the license expires."
msgstr ""
"Plaćena licenca uključuje godinu dana nadogradnji i podrške e-poštom. "
"Funkcije instaliranog plugina nastavljaju raditi nakon isteka licence."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:562
msgid "Switching from WSB HUB3"
msgstr "Prijelaz s WSB HUB3"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:564
msgid ""
"Back up your site, then deactivate WSB HUB3 without deleting its settings."
msgstr ""
"Napravite sigurnosnu kopiju web-stranice, a zatim deaktivirajte WSB HUB3 bez "
"brisanja njegovih postavki."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:565
msgid ""
"Install and activate WSB PayByCode. In PayByCode > Import WSB HUB3, review "
"and import your existing settings and order data. Import also works while "
"WSB HUB3 is inactive."
msgstr ""
"Instalirajte i aktivirajte WSB PayByCode. U odjeljku PayByCode > Uvoz WSB "
"HUB3 pregledajte i uvezite postojeće postavke i podatke narudžbi. Uvoz radi "
"i kada WSB HUB3 nije aktivan."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:566
msgid ""
"Check your bank accounts and display settings, then place a test bank "
"transfer order. Keep WSB HUB3 deactivated when using PayByCode."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite bankovne račune i postavke prikaza pa napravite testnu narudžbu s "
"bankovnom uplatom. WSB HUB3 ostavite deaktiviranim dok koristite PayByCode."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:568
msgid "Learn more about WSB PayByCode"
msgstr "Saznajte više o WSB PayByCode"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:579
msgid "Barcode"
msgstr "Barkod"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:583
msgid "WSB PayByCode"
msgstr "WSB PayByCode"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:851
msgid "Please save your HUB3 recipient settings!"
msgstr "Spremite podatke o primatelju za HUB3 dodatak!"

#  msgid "HUB3 plugin works properly only with HRK as default currency!"
#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:856
msgid "HUB3 plugin works properly only with HRK or EUR as a default currency!"
msgstr ""
"HUB3 dodatak radit će ispravno samo ako je zadana valuta trgovine HRK ili "
"EUR!"

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:867
msgid ""
"HUB3 plugin works only if \"Direct bank transfer\" payment method is active!"
msgstr ""
"HUB3 dodatak radi jedino ako je uključena metoda plaćanja \"Direktna "
"bankovna transakcija\"."

#: admin/class-wsb-hub3-admin.php:891
#, php-format
msgid ""
"HUB3 barcodes can not be generated because some recipient data is longer "
"than the HUB-3 standard allows: %s. Please shorten it."
msgstr ""
"HUB3 barkodovi se ne mogu generirati jer su neki podaci primatelja duži nego "
"što HUB-3 standard dopušta: %s. Molimo skratite ih."

