msgstr "Primjer za zadnju narudžbu %s s današnjim datumom."

#: includes/class-wsb-hub3-paybycode-notice.php:87
msgid "Barcodes & QR codes with local generation"
msgstr "Barkodovi i QR kodovi uz lokalno kreiranje"

#: includes/class-wsb-hub3-paybycode-notice.php:88
msgid ""
"WSB PayByCode is a paid plugin that supports Croatian HUB-3 barcodes and EPC/"
"SEPA QR codes for compatible banking apps. Payment codes are generated on "
"your store server without sending their data to an external barcode service. "
"It also offers payment reminders and automatic cancellations for unpaid "
"orders."
msgstr ""
"WSB PayByCode  je plaćeni plugin koji uz HUB-3 barkodove podržava i EPC/SEPA "
"QR kodove za kompatibilne bankovne aplikacije. Kodovi za plaćanje generiraju "
"se na poslužitelju trgovine bez slanja podataka vanjskom barcode servisu. "
"Nudi i podsjetnike za plaćanje te automatsko otkazivanje neplaćenih narudžbi."

#: includes/class-wsb-hub3-paybycode-notice.php:89
msgid ""
"WSB HUB3 remains free and maintained. Deactivate WSB HUB3 when switching to "
"PayByCode."
msgstr ""
"WSB HUB3 ostaje besplatan i nastavlja se održavati. Pri prelasku na "
"PayByCode deaktivirajte WSB HUB3."

